{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}
{% block title %}Privacy policy — Job Copilot{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
  <article class="prose max-w-3xl">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Job Copilot stores account, profile, resume, application, and job-interaction data to provide matching and ATS scanning. CV text and LLM outputs are retained for reprocessing and user-requested exports.</p>
    <p>Users can export or delete their account from account settings. Deletion removes database rows and stored resume objects.</p>
  </article>
{% endblock %}
